      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1852, Norwegian immigrants arrived with early settlers, establishing Spring Grove as Minnesota’s first permanent Norwegian community along Riceford Creek.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
